#: ../../source/docs/building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux.rst:90
#: 83bf4d262afb4ddab2b74bf9bb319b0e
msgid ""
"Place the SD card in your BBB. Make sure you have removed Ethernet and all "
"other USB devices from your BBB. Connect it to a wall adapter (5VDC 1A) or a"
" powered USB hub."
msgstr ""
"将 SD 卡插入 BBB。确保已从 BBB 上拔下以太网和所有其他 USB 设备。将其连接到墙壁适配器（5VDC 1A）或带电源的 USB 集线器。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux.rst:94
#: 2907cefeac4143c086801393be796565
msgid ""
"Press the boot button, and hold it down while booting, until all four blue "
"lights are solid."
msgstr "按下启动按钮并按住，直到所有四个蓝灯常亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux.rst:97
#: e98968323173412e98e7320bc7b985e6
msgid "Let go, and wait. It will take around 15 mins."
msgstr "松开，等待约 15 分钟。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux.rst:99
#: f1f553bbe73d4e7c9ee6a917ab571cbf
msgid ""
"The lights will flicker a lot at this stage, you will know it is complete "
"when the four lights return to solid Blue (no flickering). Power down the "
"BBB and remove the SD card."
msgstr "此阶段灯会频繁闪烁，当四个灯恢复为常亮蓝色（不再闪烁）时即表示完成。关闭 BBB 电源并取出 SD 卡。"

