"provided with it. Depending on your OS, install the required `drivers "
"<http://beagleboard.org/getting-started#step2>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用随附的 USB 线将 BeagleBone Black 连接到您的电脑。根据您的操作系统，安装所需的 `驱动程序 "
"<http://beagleboard.org/getting-started#step2>`__。"

